Consultations send the request, supplied discussion context, and source material
read by the peer through your native Codex or Claude Code account. Provider
processing follows that provider's account terms. Read-only tools may read
untracked or ignored project files; read-only access does not redact secrets.
Choose approved projects and context. Runner receipts stay on your computer;
native CLIs can also keep their own local session transcripts. Do not publish
those receipts, transcripts, sign-ins or other private state.
